## 3. MEDIUM GAPS â€” DIEM YEU (Priority trung binh)

### GAP-06 [SEVERITY: MEDIUM] BrainBlock::forward() â€” placeholder
```yaml
location: brain/src/block/brain_block.rs
breach: |
  forward() {
    let mut q = vec![0.0f32; self.q_proj_weight.len() / hidden.len()];
    q  // tra ve vector zero
  }
  # Tat ca cac ops (rmsnorm, rope, matmul, silu) da co san
  # nhung chua duoc goi trong forward()
  # BrainBlock import crate::vkm::LayerKv â€” VKM CHUA EXIST trong brain/src
missing: "crate::vkm module â€” KV cache type LayerKv chua implement"
fix_direction: |
  B1: Tao brain/src/vkm.rs: pub struct LayerKv { k: Vec<f32>, v: Vec<f32> }
  B2: Implement forward() dung thu tu:
    rmsnorm(hidden, rms_attn_norm_weight) -> normed
    attention_forward(normed, q/k/v weights, kv_cache, pos) -> attn_out (attention.rs co roi)
    residual: hidden + attn_out
    rmsnorm(residual, rms_ffn_norm_weight) -> normed2
    FFN: gate = silu(matmul(normed2, gate_proj)) * matmul(normed2, up_proj)
         out = matmul(gate, down_proj)
    residual: residual + out
effort: 3h
priority: P2
```

